Description: installer for Superwhisper voice dictation
 Downloads Superwhisper, a proprietary dictation program, from its vendor when
 this package is configured, checks the archive's SHA-256 and Minisign
 signature, and unpacks it under /opt/superwhisper. This package holds the
 launcher, the user service and the setup script, and none of the vendor's
 files.
